  },
  "settingsHelpSmoothThePictureWhenZoomed": "Off, a pixel magnified past 1:1 stays a square, which is what you zoom in to see. On, the picture is blended between pixels — softer, and easier on the eye when the zoom is for framing rather than for inspecting.",
