  },
  "settingsHelpShapeEasesInAPopup": "The graph editor's Easing button opens the shape editor in a small floating box instead of the Easing panel. The box closes whenever you click outside it — and choosing different keyframes is a click outside — so one drawn shape can only be tried on the selection that was live when it opened. Turn it on to save the screen space.",
