  "settingsHelpWaveformsRiseFromTheBottom": "A waveform stands on the floor of its row instead of being centred about silence, each column reaching up by how far the sound swung either way. Half of a centred wave is a mirror of the other half, so this spends the whole row on the half that says something — useful in a short row. Applies to the single wave and the frequency stack alike.",
